---
description: Do not add tests unless explicitly requested
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Tests

- Do not add new test files (e.g. `*.test.ts`, `*.spec.ts`, `__tests__/`).
- Do not add new test cases to existing test files.
- Do not refactor code primarily to make it testable unless the user asks.
- Do not suggest adding tests or offer to write them unless the user asks.
- Only add or modify tests when the user explicitly requests tests, test coverage, or a test for a specific behavior.
